<BaseLayout title="Work | Jeremy Hoover">
  <Container>
    <h1>WHAT I DO FOR WORK</h1>
    <p>
      Currently, I work as a developer on the Growth team at a founder-led SaaS company in Toronto.
      As a team, we work to help users quickly understand and find value in the product. I have been
      there since 2021, when the company was less than 30 employees. I’m grateful for the positive
      and very smart people I get to work with each day. Previous roles for me include working at a
      marketing agency, non-profit and a TV channel.
    </p>
    <p>
      Outside of my daily role, I help one of my favourite local charities <a
        href="https://www.thebabydepot.org"
        target="_blank">The Baby Depot ↗</a
      > by building and maintaining their website. I also created their brand identity when they were
      first getting started.
    </p>
    <p>
      I also help out with a YouTube channel <a href="https://www.debossgarage.com" target="_blank"
        >Deboss Garage ↗</a
      >. We have done some pretty fun things on their site, like when during the Covid-19 pandemic
      we ran an online car show, involving a bunch of YouTube creators and receiving thousands of
      video submissions. The site includes member features, and a world map of interesting car
      projects.
    </p>
    <p>
      I’m always interested in talking about new opportunities, if you would like to work on a
      project together, please <a href="/contact/">get in touch</a>.
    </p>
  </Container>
</BaseLayout>
